'''Ice Dragon''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it for 750 [[Blue Tokens]] {{Currency|Blue Token}} during the [[Christmas Event 2016|2016 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade appears to be a large geometric-shaped icicle made up of many shades of ice blue.It has a white line in the middle of it. The guard features four shards of ice with three small icy crystals placed in the center of it. The handle, clipped to the middle of the guard, has a paracord design over it with an icy pommel attached to the bottom of it.

== Trivia ==
* Its model derives from the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/168141301/Ice-Dragon-Slayer Ice Dragon Slayer], purchasable from the avatar shop for 350 Robux.
*Its model, published by [[Nikilis]], can be found [https://www.roblox.com/library/585846454/Ice here].
*This is one of the many knives that can be found in other Murder games.
* When salvaged, it provides 16 godly [[shards]].

